      "parameters": {
        "width": 616,
        "height": 648,
        "content": "## Try It Out\n\n### Workflows\n----------\n 1. Via n8n form select files to dub for desired languages.\n 2. Listen webhook and whenever dubbing finishes upload to desired platforms\n\n\n### How to Use\n\n - Obtain Api Key from https://dublab.app, set as variable or just update on nodes.\n - Grab Webhook Url and add to DubLab App\n - Setup upload providers (Telegram, Box, Dropbox, YouTube, Postiz etc.)\n\n\n### Used Stacks\n - DubLab App (ApiKey, Webhook Setup Required)\n - Telegram (Token Required)\n - Box (Oauth2 Required)\n - Dropbox (Oauth2 Required)\n - Youtube (Oauth2 Required)\n - Postiz (ApiKey Required)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
